<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23292" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυον</span></b> , τό, used in
		sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυον,</span> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυα, -ύων, -ύοις,</span>
		
			Ep.
		 gen. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακρυόφι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φιν</span>) <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			17.696
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			5.152
		</span></i>, etc.: (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυ</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tear,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. θερμὰ χέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. λείβειν, εἴβειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				13.88
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.153
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλεφάρων ἄπο δ. ἧκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς δάκρυα πεσεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴσχειν πηγὰς δακρύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					803
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ πολλῶν δ. ἱκετεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					34c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>that which drops like tears, gum, sap,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀκάνθης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.96
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρομμύου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.201
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δένδρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					553b28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπέλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.298
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἤλεκτρον καὶ ὅσα λέγεται ὡς
					δάκρυα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					388b19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κάμωνος,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαμμωνία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				484
			</span></i>; of the bulbils of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίνον</span>
			(q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.2.1
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυμαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.527
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Theodorid.
			</span></i>).</div>
